{"id":"n72201-1-10","stage":5,"title":"일그러지다 · 皱","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72201-1-10-1","ko":"사고가 났었다며? 어디 다친 데는 없어?","zh":"听说发生了事故？有没有哪里受伤？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사고가","meaning":"事故","explanation":"사고：事故；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사고","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66370","senseId":"1","lemma":"사고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"났었다며?","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；었었：回顾已经结束或与现在情况有区别的过去。；다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다친","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"데는","meaning":"事情，东西。","explanation":"데：事情，东西。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"데","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47455","senseId":"2","lemma":"데","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없어?","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"3","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2b04ea5b795422b7","term":"사고","zh":"事故","audio":"/audio/2b04ea5b795422b77c61.mp3","entryId":"66370","definition":"意料之外发生的不好的事情。","pronunciation":["사ː고"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"128510caa5a5a0b6","term":"다치다","zh":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3","entryId":"73400","definition":"被撞到或被打后身上或身体的一部分出现伤口；或指使出现伤口。","pronunciation":["다치다"]},{"id":"16cb0f76ae2e2fc7","term":"데","zh":"事情，东西。","audio":"/audio/16cb0f76ae2e2fc7131f.mp3","entryId":"47455","definition":"事情，东西。","pronunciation":["데"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"不发生某个事情或症状。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/92dd28713ca04f6893e6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72201-1-10-2","ko":"나는 괜찮은데 차가 완전히 일그러져 폐차했어.","zh":"我没事，不过车已经严重变形，不得不报废了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"괜찮은데","meaning":"无恙，没事","explanation":"괜찮다：无恙，没事；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"2","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"차가","meaning":"车，车辆","explanation":"차：车，车辆；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"차","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62525","senseId":"1","lemma":"차","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"완전히","meaning":"完全地，完美地，彻底地","explanation":"완전히：完全地，完美地，彻底地","readings":[{"term":"완전히","audio":"/audio/b38cc705c97aaddc4849.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67847","senseId":"1","lemma":"완전히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"일그러져","meaning":"皱，瘪，歪","explanation":"일그러지다：皱，瘪，歪；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"일그러지다","audio":"/audio/d2283c54c8d51c8b0d9c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72201","senseId":"1","lemma":"일그러지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"폐차했어.","meaning":"报废","explanation":"폐차하다：报废；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"폐차하다","audio":"/audio/83600c150bba986d5d76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83271","senseId":"1","lemma":"폐차하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"无恙，没事","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"没有特别的问题。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]},{"id":"6ccd3f82b0317e51","term":"차","zh":"车，车辆","audio":"/audio/6ccd3f82b0317e51da2a.mp3","entryId":"62525","definition":"搬运人或行李的带轮子的机械。","pronunciation":["차"]},{"id":"b38cc705c97aaddc","term":"완전히","zh":"完全地，完美地，彻底地","audio":"/audio/b38cc705c97aaddc4849.mp3","entryId":"67847","definition":"没有不足之处，具备完整无缺没有瑕疵地。","pronunciation":["완전히"]},{"id":"d2283c54c8d51c8b","term":"일그러지다","zh":"皱，瘪，歪","audio":"/audio/d2283c54c8d51c8b0d9c.mp3","entryId":"72201","definition":"东西或脸部等扭曲或皱纹增多。","pronunciation":["일그러지다"]},{"id":"83600c150bba986d","term":"폐차하다","zh":"报废","audio":"/audio/83600c150bba986d5d76.mp3","entryId":"83271","definition":"销毁废旧车辆。","pronunciation":["폐ː차하다","페ː차하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2db85b2a85c00766c95c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.47,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=72201","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":167,"sequenceScore":3.2967,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["听说发生了事故？有没有哪里受伤？","我没事，不过车已经严重变形，不得不报废了。","你妹妹打电话来，说要借点钱。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说发生了事故？有没有哪里受伤？","我没事，不过车已经严重变形，不得不报废了。","你妹妹打电话来，说要借点钱。"],"answer":1}]}
